1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:02,142
(Raj:)Oh, he's got me.

2
00:00:02,314 --> 00:00:04,814
(Howard:)Sheldon, he's got Raj.
Use your sleep spell.

3
00:00:05,192 --> 00:00:06,732
Sheldon. Sheldon.

4
00:00:06,902 --> 00:00:10,992
(Sheldon:)I've got the Sword of Azeroth.

5
00:00:11,156 --> 00:00:14,196
- Forget the sword, Sheldon, help Raj.
- There is no more Sheldon.

6
00:00:14,367 --> 00:00:16,577
I am the sword master.

7
00:00:16,745 --> 00:00:19,165
- Leonard, look out.
- Damn it, man, we're dying here.

8
00:00:19,331 --> 00:00:20,751
(Sheldon:)Goodbye, peasants.

9
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:21,956
[WHOOSHING ON LAPTOPS]

10
00:00:22,125 --> 00:00:23,255
(Leonard:)The bastard teleported.

11
00:00:25,087 --> 00:00:28,337
(Raj:)He's selling the Sword of Azeroth
on eBay.

12
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,380
You betrayed us for money?
Who are you?

13
00:00:31,551 --> 00:00:32,841
(Sheldon:)I'm a rogue knight elf.

14
00:00:33,011 --> 00:00:35,511
(Sheldon:)Don't you people
read character descriptions?

15
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:38,140
(Sheldon:)Wait, wait, wait.
Somebody just clicked "Buy It Now."

16
00:00:38,308 --> 00:00:41,518
I am the sword master.

